        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Ideogram 4: text-to-image, Hires. fix\n\nIdeogram 4 (Qwen3-VL 8B text encoder, FLUX.2 VAE) is strong at typography and layout. Write full sentences,\nput literal text in quotes and say where it goes. Guidance comes from a second, **unconditional** model\n(**Dual Model CFG Guider**), so there is no negative prompt; **CFG Override** lowers CFG to 3 over the last 30 % of\nthe steps.\n\n**Presets** (steps / Shift = scheduler `mu` / scheduler `std`): Default 20 / 0 / 1.75, Quality 48 / 0 / 1.5,\nTurbo 12 / 0.5 / 1.75. CFG 7, euler, 1024×1024 (multiples of 16, at least 256). `std` is set in the scheduler.\n\n## Image Bench\n\n| Marker | Node | Generate tab |\n|--------|------|--------------|\n| `ib:cp` | Load Diffusion Model (the conditional model) | model list, model exploration |\n| `ib:pp` | Image Bench Prompt | prompt and LoRA list |\n| `ib:smp` | SamplerCustomAdvanced | seed (RandomNoise), steps and Shift (Ideogram 4 Scheduler `steps`, `mu`), CFG scale (Dual Model CFG Guider), sampling method, size (Width / Height) |\n| `ib:smp:1` | Hires. fix sampler | Hires. fix: upscaler (Hires. fix upscaler), scale (Hires. fix scale), steps (Hires. fix scheduler), denoising (Hires. fix denoise) |\n| `ib:hr` | Hires. fix (If/Else Switch) | Hires. fix checkbox; switched on by the Upscale button |\n| `ib:lora` | Load LoRA (bypassed) | LoRA exploration only |\n\n**Hires. fix** upscales the first pass to *Upscale by* (1.5×), encodes it again and samples the last *denoising*\npart of an Ideogram 4 schedule computed for the new size: 20 hires steps at 0.4 run 8 steps. It shares noise,\nguider and sampler with the first pass.\n\n**Upscaler**: **Hires. fix upscaler** (`Load Upscale Model`, the Upscaler list of the Generate tab)\nenlarges the first pass by its own factor, and **Resize to the hires size** brings it to the first pass size ×\n*Upscale by* (**Hires. fix scale** only computes that size). Put any ESRGAN-type model into\n`models/upscale_models` ([RealESRGAN_x4plus.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Real-ESRGAN_repackaged/resolve/main/RealESRGAN_x4plus.safetensors) here). The loader must name an installed model\neven while Hires. fix is off, since ComfyUI checks every node before running.\n\n**Hires. fix ib:hr** (`If/Else Switch`) is the Hires. fix checkbox of the Generate tab: on, it saves the\nHires. fix image; off, the first pass image, and the Hires. fix nodes do not run (its inputs are lazy). The\n**Upscale** button of the image lists switches it on, generates the image again with its seed and parameters, and\nswitches it back, so drafts made with Hires. fix off can be upscaled later (keep the size the same).\n\n**LoRAs**: check them in the LoRA list or type `<lora:name:weight>` into the prompt. They apply to the conditional\nmodel only.\n\nThe Generate tab has no negative prompt and no References panel here: Ideogram 4 takes no reference images. The\nControlNet tab has no units: there is no ControlNet for Ideogram 4.\n\n## Model Links\n\n**diffusion_models**: [ideogram4_fp8_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Ideogram-4/resolve/main/diffusion_models/ideogram4_fp8_scaled.safetensors), [ideogram4_unconditional_fp8_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Ideogram-4/resolve/main/diffusion_models/ideogram4_unconditional_fp8_scaled.safetensors)\n**text_encoders**: [qwen3vl_8b_fp8_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen3-VL/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_8b_fp8_scaled.safetensors)\n**vae**: [flux2-vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-dev/resolve/main/split_files/vae/flux2-vae.safetensors)\n"
      ],
      "title": "Note: Ideogram 4 (Image Bench, all features)",
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
